# Vercel builds only the web tier from this repository.
#
# The Python engine is a real, tested part of the product but it is not deployed here: it is a
# local/self-hosted surface reached by the CLI and the MCP server as a subprocess. Excluding it
# also stops Vercel from detecting it as a second (Python) service, which would make the
# top-level framework and build settings ambiguous.
